    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@83912",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLOTEN.\nCome, there’s no more tribute to be paid. Our kingdom is stronger than it was at that time; and, as I said, there is no moe such Cæsars. Other of them may have crook’d noses; but to owe such straight arms, none.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@83912/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@83912/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 219,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1132751,
        "end": 1133002,
        "line": 43084,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@83912",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_7.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLOTEN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84167",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CYMBELINE.\nSon, let your mother end.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84167/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84167/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 36,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1133006,
        "end": 1133072,
        "line": 43091,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@84167",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_7.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CYMBELINE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84237",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLOTEN.\nWe have yet many among us can gripe as hard as Cassibelan. I do not say I am one; but I have a hand. Why tribute? Why should we pay tribute? If Cæsar can hide the sun from us with a blanket, or put the moon in his pocket, we will pay him tribute for light; else, sir, no more tribute, pray you now.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84237/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84237/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 306,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1133076,
        "end": 1133415,
        "line": 43096,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@84237",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_7.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLOTEN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84580",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CYMBELINE.\nYou must know,\nTill the injurious Romans did extort\nThis tribute from us, we were free. Cæsar’s ambition,\nWhich swell’d so much that it did almost stretch\nThe sides o’ th’ world, against all colour here\nDid put the yoke upon’s; which to shake off\nBecomes a warlike people, whom we reckon\nOurselves to be.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84580/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84580/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 25,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84580/line-3",
          "start": 26,
          "end": 62,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
