      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLOTEN.\nWe do.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84964/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@84964/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 14,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1133803,
        "end": 1133847,
        "line": 43116,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@84964",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_7.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLOTEN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@85012",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CYMBELINE.\nSay then to Cæsar,\nOur ancestor was that Mulmutius which\nOrdain’d our laws, whose use the sword of Cæsar\nHath too much mangled; whose repair and franchise\nShall, by the power we hold, be our good deed,\nThough Rome be therefore angry. Mulmutius made our laws,\nWho was the first of Britain which did put\nHis brows within a golden crown, and call’d\nHimself a king.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@85012/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@85012/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 29,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@85012/line-3",
          "start": 30,
          "end": 67,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@85012/line-4",
          "start": 68,
          "end": 115,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneIII_7.1/p@85012/line-5",
          "start": 116,
          "end": 165,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
